[Music]  with the success of the first sonic the  hedgehog it came as no surprise that  paramount quickly greenlighted a second  film now that it's here critics have  started to weigh in here's what rotten  tomatoes reviews are saying about sonic  the hedgehog 2. following its theatrical  debut in january of 2020 the first sonic  the hedgehog movie ended up becoming the  highest grossing film adapted from a  video game of all time it was hardly a  shock then when its producers at  paramount publicly announced that they  had begun work on a second sonic movie  shortly after the premiere of the first  now that the second movie is here  reviews have begun surfacing online on  the whole opinions are mixed suggesting  that while existing sonic fans can't  expect more of what they liked about the  first sonic movie it's less essential  viewing for those with no interest in  the famous video game mascot here's what  some of the reviews collected by rotten  tomatoes have to say  quick stretch little snack and here we  go timeout reviewer ali richards awarded  sonic the hedgehog 2 a total of 2 stars  out of 5. he wrote most of the casts  work hard to sell a script peppered with  fart jokes and uninspired set pieces but  it's so chaotically plotted that it  quickly becomes exhausting in his review  for variety peter de bruges was  similarly critical of sonic the hedgehog  2 singling out its 2-hour run time as  feeling overly long and accusing  paramount of rushing the movie's  production according to debruce sonic 2  wears out its welcome well before it  turns into yet another phonetin  franchise entry comparatively author  carlos aguilar felt more positive about  the film as reflected in his review for  the rap he wrote proof that one can  elevate a mostly disposable franchise  investing in the casting and screenplay  sonic the hedgehog 2 doesn't harbor any  illusions of being a beacon of cinema  but within its department as the  harmless option for family viewing  drawing spring break it offers enough  surprises to be more pleasant than  unbearable like plenty of other aspects  of sonic the hedgehog 2 opinions about  its cast range from outright praise to  slight condemnation that said even some  reviewers that expressed a negative  opinion about the movie as a whole had  kind things to say about some of its  cast members in a moderately positive  review of the film for the hollywood  reporter justin lowe singled out both  jim carrey's performance as a villainous  dr robotnik and ben schwartz as a  titular sonic he explained his opinion  by saying kerry relies on an array of  facial tics enhanced by an outsized  mustache and erratic body language  characteristic of the expertly timed  physical humor that is perfected over a  series of similarly outlandish comedic  roles meanwhile schwartz nails animated  hedgehog's snarky impudent attitude and  unrestrained thirds for thrills even if  sonic's frequently frantic tone grows  increasingly worrying in the independent  clarice luffry praise schwartz's  enthusiasm for portraying sonic while  criticizing carey's performance she  explained he stands around trying to  turn bits of exposition into jokes by  gunning and over enunciating every line  ali richards meanwhile spoke more  positively about the cast in his review  for timeout praising schwartz kerry  james marston and tikka sumter alike in  his opinion the mvp however is natasha  rothwell as maddie's sister rachel whose  role is beefed up from the first film  another key component of sonic the  hedgehog 2 that divided reviewers is its  script overall some reviews singled out  its writing as one of the film's strong  suits while others shared pointed  critiques of its screenplay  you are terrible at this your negative  attitude is not helping for variety  peter de bruges praised the sonic 2's  screenwriting team's ability to adapt  the plot of a video game into a  film-ready story however he also  described the sequel as taking what was  endearing about the original in a word  personality and rendering it generic in  a hurry in his review for thr justin  lowe highlighted how the film's  formulaic structure results in a  rapid-fire series of big action  sequences in his opinion these sequences  sometimes underline the reliance on too  much over-the-top cartoonish action with  borderline bonkers plot development  breathlessly deployed at a clip  recalling the movie's video game origins  the rap reviewer carlos aguilar  meanwhile was kinder to the sonic the  hedgehog 2 scripts though he repeatedly  noted that it never transcends the fact  that it's in service of financial return  above all else compared to the first  film aguilar describes sonic 2 as a  similarly enjoyable cash cow with some  welcomed if far from revolutionary  idiosyncrasy  fans can judge for themselves when they  head to their favorite theater to watch  sonic the hedgehog 2.  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite new movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]  you

